{"attack":"在使用招式2回合后，向对手发送一团念力进行攻击。","description":"使对方宝可梦所在的位置陷入未来攻击状态。\n\n对已经陷入未来攻击状态的位置使用则会失败。\n2回合后，未来攻击状态解除，所在位置的宝可梦受到超能力属性的伤害。此时：\n\n若预知未来的使用者在场上，未来攻击的伤害按照双方当前能力值进行计算。若使用者携带的道具有效，其效果也会发动（除贝壳之铃和节拍器）。\n例如，携带生命宝珠会提高未来攻击的伤害，使用者也会扣除ＨＰ。\n若预知未来的使用者不在场上，未来攻击的伤害按照使用者原本的能力值进行计算，且不受使用者携带道具的影响。\n精神场地会提高超能力属性未来攻击的伤害，无论使用者此时是否在场上。\n未来攻击的伤害不能被守住抵挡。\n该招式不能被鹦鹉学舌学习。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Kadabra","Level":45},{"Name":"Alakazam","Level":45},{"Name":"Drowzee","Level":49},{"Name":"Hypno","Level":56},{"Name":"Articuno form:galarian","Level":65},{"Name":"Mewtwo","Level":88},{"Name":"Natu","Level":45},{"Name":"Xatu","Level":55},{"Name":"Espeon","Level":50},{"Name":"Lugia","Level":81},{"Name":"Ho-Oh","Level":81},{"Name":"Celebi","Level":70},{"Name":"Ralts","Level":39},{"Name":"Kirlia","Level":53},{"Name":"Gardevoir","Level":63},{"Name":"Lunatone form:gibbous","Level":40},{"Name":"Lunatone form:quarter","Level":40},{"Name":"Lunatone form:full","Level":40},{"Name":"Lunatone form:new_moon","Level":40},{"Name":"Lunatone form:crescent","Level":40},{"Name":"Barboach","Level":42},{"Name":"Whiscash","Level":48},{"Name":"Duskull","Level":44},{"Name":"Dusclops","Level":48},{"Name":"Absol","Level":50},{"Name":"Jirachi","Level":70},{"Name":"Bronzor","Level":44},{"Name":"Bronzong","Level":50},{"Name":"Gallade","Level":0},{"Name":"Dusknoir","Level":48},{"Name":"Uxie","Level":63},{"Name":"Mesprit","Level":63},{"Name":"Azelf","Level":63},{"Name":"Cresselia","Level":66},{"Name":"Arceus","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:grass","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:fire","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:water","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:flying","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:bug","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:poison","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:electric","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:psychic","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:rock","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:ground","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:dark","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:ghost","Level":60},{"Name":"Arceus form:steel